    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/releases/tag/v1.78.1"&gt;Release v1.78.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This is release 1.78.1 (&lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/master/doc/g_stands_for.md"&gt;gutsy&lt;/a&gt;) of gRPC Core.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For gRPC documentation, see &lt;a href="https://grpc.io/" rel="nofollow"&gt;grpc.io&lt;/a&gt;. For previous releases, see &lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/releases"&gt;Releases&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release contains refinements, improvements, and bug fixes, with highlights listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Python&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove unintentional log &lt;code&gt;WARNING: All log messages before absl::InitializeLog() is called are written to STDERR.&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3946891036" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/41639" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/41639/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/41639"&gt;#41639&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix inconsistent &lt;code&gt;GRPC_ENABLE_FORK_SUPPORT&lt;/code&gt; runtime defaults between gRPC Core and Python. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3919334121" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/41588" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/41588/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/41588"&gt;#41588&lt;/a&gt;).
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This fixed &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2523506106" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/37710" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/issues/37710/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/37710"&gt;#37710&lt;/a&gt;, a request processing hang in certain multithreaded environments: &lt;code&gt;Other threads are currently calling into gRPC, skipping fork() handlers&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernize the API Docs site: &lt;a href="https://grpc.github.io/grpc/python" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://grpc.github.io/grpc/python&lt;/a&gt;. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3858971015" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/41494" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/41494/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/41494"&gt;#41494&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ruby&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build/test ruby 4.0 and build native gems with Ruby 4.0 support. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3894958812" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/41554" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/41554/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/41554"&gt;#41554&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
